      children: "This hybrid architecture uses zero-shot routing to identify when specialized capabilities are needed, then applies the appropriate strategy for each subtask. The pattern is common in production systems: a lightweight zero-shot orchestrator delegates to more expensive or complex few-shot and tool-using components only when necessary."
    }), "\n", _jsx(_components.p, {
